cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CUA-WM: Augmenting Frozen Computer-Use Agents with SFT-Based World Modeling"
abstract: >-
  A five-step pipeline that wraps a frozen OpenCUA-7B computer-use agent in a
  learned world model — state estimation, candidate action generation,
  LoRA-fine-tuned transition prediction, LLM-as-judge scoring, and response
  assembly — improving OSWorld success rate from 24.8% to 31.0% and
  infeasible-task recognition from 44.4% to 85.7% without retraining the policy.
type: software
authors:
